The Dead Empire of Calarium was a land of the Dark Ages that held the lands now known as [[Geography/Færrin/Tormeré/index|Tormeré]], [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/index|Calaria]] and [[Geography/Færrin/Brithwyn/index|Brithwyn]]. A lich-king ruled it. It was the northern front of the Eddic Crusade, fought by the six heroes, their sacred host and [[Org/The Accord|the Accord]].
